WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.940
"There are too many adventurers."
"I don't like the smell of them."

00:04.380 --> 00:06.780
"The tourists litter."

00:07.020 --> 00:09.140
"Please build a theatre."

00:09.140 --> 00:10.680
"Please build more roads."

00:10.680 --> 00:13.400
"Please station knights in Avancier."

00:14.580 --> 00:17.680
These are the requests
of the town residents.

00:19.020 --> 00:20.500
There are more besides those.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.080
Please go through them, Big Brother.

00:23.520 --> 00:25.660
I'll go clean up.

00:25.660 --> 00:28.400
Lime, let's race to the second floor!

00:33.090 --> 00:38.380
The sound of Manicia running energetically
up the stairs is truly wonderful.

00:39.260 --> 00:40.680
Still...

00:40.860 --> 00:42.800
I didn't expect
to receive so many petitions.

00:42.800 --> 00:45.720
I'm glad we formed an alliance
with the two major clans,

00:45.740 --> 00:48.560
but even problems can arise
from such rapid development.

00:50.400 --> 00:51.820
Rud, come with me!

00:55.500 --> 00:56.900
Nin? What's wrong?

00:56.900 --> 00:57.700
This way!

00:59.000 --> 01:00.820
This girl collapsed on the road.

01:04.840 --> 01:07.400
She's a Homunculus.

01:11.300 --> 01:13.280
Please… Please help us!

01:13.760 --> 01:15.420
I have friends!

01:15.580 --> 01:17.740
We were attacked
in the forest nearby!

01:17.740 --> 01:18.780
Let's go.

01:18.780 --> 01:19.480
Yes.

01:19.700 --> 01:21.920
Master, I'll go too.

01:22.180 --> 01:24.860
No, you need to stay here, Luna.

01:25.860 --> 01:28.300
You treated her injuries.

01:28.300 --> 01:29.980
She'll feel safer with you here.

01:32.440 --> 01:33.840
I understand.

01:45.060 --> 01:54.880
(The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids,
A Tank with a Rare 9999 Resistance Skill
Got Kicked from the Hero’s Party)

03:05.820 --> 03:07.700
Around the labyrinth?

03:08.220 --> 03:11.340
But I'm the one managing
the labyrinth right now.

03:11.340 --> 03:13.870
There shouldn't be monsters
spawning outside.

03:15.120 --> 03:15.990
Found them!

03:17.660 --> 03:20.620
The Homunculi are
fighting each other!

03:21.940 --> 03:25.040
One side's clearly at a disadvantage.

03:25.120 --> 03:29.940
And the side that's under attack
clearly has emotions like the girl we found.

03:37.160 --> 03:40.520
I am an adventurer
from a nearby town called Avancier.

03:41.640 --> 03:43.240
Listen to me.

03:43.520 --> 03:44.200
Please!

03:47.560 --> 03:48.620
It's not working.

03:50.960 --> 03:54.060
Your friend came to our town
and asked me to help you.

03:58.920 --> 04:01.740
That girl's abilities are on par
with the pursuers.

04:06.100 --> 04:09.320
You must be the Homunculi she meant.

04:14.940 --> 04:17.140
Yes, it's us.

04:17.519 --> 04:19.839
So, who are these?

04:20.779 --> 04:24.520
They are combat-type Homunculi
from Brunn Quelez.

04:26.050 --> 04:27.620
Brunn Quelez?

04:28.120 --> 04:30.380
Luna escaped from that country.

04:30.680 --> 04:32.100
In other words,

04:32.100 --> 04:33.760
these are illegally created Homunculi.

04:34.810 --> 04:37.100
Nin, heal them.

04:37.100 --> 04:38.000
On it.

04:39.820 --> 04:41.600
Area High Heal!

04:41.760 --> 04:43.660
I was wondering
what all the ruckus was about.

04:44.100 --> 04:46.640
It appears things
have gotten a bit tricky.

04:49.740 --> 04:51.700
It's only natural
that they would feel uneasy.

04:51.700 --> 04:54.760
After all, something forbidden
suddenly appeared before them.

04:55.540 --> 04:58.100
So even though they're
combat-type Homunculi,

04:58.100 --> 05:00.780
they don't possess emotions
or consciousness like you guys do?

05:01.390 --> 05:02.360
That's right.

05:02.880 --> 05:09.000
They're only after us to complete the order
to exterminate all those who escaped.

05:09.720 --> 05:10.820
I see.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.940
That means we'll have to defeat them.

05:14.320 --> 05:16.700
Although they're Homunculi…

05:16.990 --> 05:18.680
No, that's precisely why I can't do it.

05:19.900 --> 05:22.400
Because they might be able

05:22.400 --> 05:26.540
to laugh or cry like Luna...

05:27.020 --> 05:28.640
Can't you bring yourself to do it?

05:28.880 --> 05:29.780
Amon.

05:29.780 --> 05:32.800
In the end, they are merely puppets

05:33.360 --> 05:37.520
bestowed a semblance of life.

05:37.960 --> 05:42.000
Her words are cold, but she must have
said them for my peace of mind.

05:46.200 --> 05:48.460
Their movements don't
seem very swift.

05:51.600 --> 05:54.500
They can still attack
even after losing a limb.

05:54.920 --> 05:57.500
This is indeed something
only a Homunculus could do.

06:05.740 --> 06:07.300
I won't be able to block it in time.

06:09.660 --> 06:11.400
It's different from before.

06:11.400 --> 06:13.260
Is it because I still have
my shield force?

06:13.260 --> 06:15.760
I feel much lighter than usual.

06:22.760 --> 06:24.300
Finally, it's over.

06:24.310 --> 06:26.960
Rud, I've healed them.

06:27.840 --> 06:29.060
Um...

06:29.460 --> 06:33.580
Your friend is in something
like a house of ours.

06:33.900 --> 06:35.160
Will you come too?

06:36.310 --> 06:39.500
Some look uneasy,
while others are filled with hostility.

06:39.500 --> 06:41.040
They really are quite different.

06:41.460 --> 06:42.900
But we can't force them.

06:42.900 --> 06:46.200
The way they're dressed,
they must've been treated very inhumanely.

06:46.460 --> 06:48.900
They likely hate humans too.

06:49.080 --> 06:49.900
Um...

06:50.840 --> 06:53.960
If you'll let us, can we come with you?

06:54.740 --> 06:57.700
Honestly, I don't like humans.

06:58.460 --> 07:00.440
But some of us are wounded,

07:00.980 --> 07:03.300
and we have nowhere else to go.

07:07.800 --> 07:10.700
We brought
the Homunculi we rescued

07:10.960 --> 07:13.380
to the clan house.

07:14.240 --> 07:16.300
That settles it for now.

07:16.300 --> 07:19.600
We can protect them here,
but what do you plan to do next?

07:20.440 --> 07:23.500
They're Homunculi from Brunn Quelez.

07:23.500 --> 07:26.420
Then we must inform
the governor at the lord's mansion.

07:26.600 --> 07:29.420
The information will reach
the upper echelons of the country.

07:29.890 --> 07:31.860
If that happens,
we can't protect them anymore.

07:32.680 --> 07:35.380
And the townsfolk
might also be wary of them.

07:35.740 --> 07:36.860
I know.

07:37.610 --> 07:40.260
- Fortunately, Avancier's governor is kind.
- You can stay here without worry.

07:40.760 --> 07:42.860
He will hear us out, at the very least.

07:44.300 --> 07:45.220
Um...

07:46.340 --> 07:48.020
Thank you for helping us.

07:48.180 --> 07:49.820
My name is Fia.

07:50.940 --> 07:52.890
Are you going to meet
with the authorities?

07:53.300 --> 07:54.260
Yes.

07:54.260 --> 07:56.260
Can I come with you?

07:57.140 --> 08:00.310
It might be easier for a party involved
to speak to them.

08:00.310 --> 08:04.380
They probably want to know
about the situation in Brunn Quelez too.

08:04.790 --> 08:07.340
But they might be cautious of you.

08:07.660 --> 08:10.920
Well, you can tie up my hands and feet.

08:11.740 --> 08:14.760
I'm not one not to repay my debts.

08:15.100 --> 08:17.960
I'll tell you everything I can.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.400
I see.

08:20.860 --> 08:23.520
But there's no need
to tie up your hands and feet.

08:24.840 --> 08:25.940
In that case...

08:28.260 --> 08:29.700
I've never seen her before.

08:29.960 --> 08:33.440
I heard a group of people with magic stones
on them were brought to the clan house.

08:34.090 --> 08:35.740
Mr. Rud led them there.

08:35.740 --> 08:37.760
Are they Homunculi?

08:37.760 --> 08:39.299
Is this really all right?

08:40.539 --> 08:42.299
Um, Rud...

08:42.419 --> 08:43.200
Yes?

08:43.580 --> 08:46.190
I asked you to hold my hand
as a safety precaution,

08:46.190 --> 08:48.400
but we've certainly
attracted a lot of attention.

08:49.640 --> 08:52.100
Sorry if I caused you trouble.

08:52.100 --> 08:53.480
I don't think that at all.

08:54.600 --> 08:55.920
I'm the one who should apologise.

08:56.240 --> 09:00.480
The people of Avancier
have never seen a Homunculus.

09:01.380 --> 09:03.400
But they don't mean any ill intent.

09:03.400 --> 09:05.300
It's okay. I don't mind.

09:05.900 --> 09:09.900
We were prepared
before we left that country.

09:11.040 --> 09:11.860
I see.

09:15.190 --> 09:18.200
Also, you don't have
to force yourself to smile.

09:19.100 --> 09:21.260
At least not when you're with me.

09:26.100 --> 09:28.380
I see. I understand what happened.

09:31.700 --> 09:34.300
It's been hard on you, Fia.

09:36.100 --> 09:39.780
So that country is
really creating Homunculi.

09:40.240 --> 09:42.780
Were you already aware of this, sir?

09:42.780 --> 09:45.300
Only rumours.

09:45.300 --> 09:49.260
I hear they do not treat
the Homunculi kindly.

09:49.500 --> 09:53.660
Can I shelter them in this town
to protect them?

09:53.660 --> 09:54.980
To protect them?

09:55.320 --> 09:58.580
Of course, them having nowhere else
to go is one of the reasons.

09:58.590 --> 10:01.260
But more importantly, if they stay,

10:01.260 --> 10:03.800
they may solve the problem
of the lack of manpower.

10:03.800 --> 10:06.660
Are you planning
to hire the Homunculi?

10:06.960 --> 10:07.860
Precisely.

10:07.860 --> 10:12.420
They possess their own will
and can act accordingly.

10:14.810 --> 10:16.580
You make a fair point.

10:16.580 --> 10:18.380
I could tell
just by looking at this child.

10:19.420 --> 10:21.340
They're nothing different
from humans,

10:21.680 --> 10:23.600
and they're very expressive.

10:26.800 --> 10:28.700
Well then, Fia,
I have some questions for you.

10:28.700 --> 10:30.660
When it comes to the Homunculi,

10:30.660 --> 10:33.800
Commander-type with thinking ability
and self-awareness

10:34.210 --> 10:36.640
and combat-type
with enhanced combat skills.

10:36.640 --> 10:39.840
Besides these, there seem
to be various types of Homunculi.

10:41.300 --> 10:45.080
Do you know the reason for such
rapid advancement of Homunculi technology?

10:45.540 --> 10:46.660
Well,

10:47.100 --> 10:50.360
it's said that about 20 years ago,

10:50.360 --> 10:53.490
a man known as Demon Lord Greed
appeared in Brunn Quelez.

10:53.490 --> 10:54.380
A demon lord?

10:54.760 --> 10:57.080
We all thought demon lords
were fictional.

10:57.080 --> 10:58.840
Why would he appear in Brunn Quelez?

10:59.040 --> 11:01.260
I don't know the exact reason,

11:01.420 --> 11:06.600
but it seems that the remarkable
development of Homunculus technology

11:06.600 --> 11:08.060
is indeed caused
by Demon Lord Greed.

11:09.760 --> 11:12.980
Even now, they continue
to mass-produce Homunculi like us.

11:15.400 --> 11:16.920
I understand the general situation.

11:16.920 --> 11:19.840
I'll convey this information
to higher-ups.

11:19.840 --> 11:23.160
Furthermore, we will provide
your group protection in Avancier.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.720
Thank you very much!

11:27.200 --> 11:30.020
Looks like we get to stay in town
for the time being.

11:30.380 --> 11:31.220
Yes.

11:31.220 --> 11:35.180
But in a way you guys are
also being monitored.

11:35.180 --> 11:36.480
I understand.

11:36.790 --> 11:37.690
By the way,

11:37.690 --> 11:41.760
wasn't there a girl back in the forest who can
battle against a combat-type homunculus?

11:42.020 --> 11:43.800
Samimina?

11:44.460 --> 11:47.820
She's pretty tough
for a commander-type Homunculus.

11:48.180 --> 11:51.680
If anything were to happen,
she could be a formidable force.

11:52.440 --> 11:56.280
She's not the friendliest,
but she genuinely cares for her friends.

11:56.280 --> 11:58.660
I can see that.

11:59.130 --> 12:00.020
(Chuckle)

12:00.420 --> 12:05.480
Some of our kind resent humans
for horrible things they did to us.

12:06.080 --> 12:08.100
But you helped us and let us know

12:08.840 --> 12:12.980
that there are human beings out there
who will treat Homunculi kindly.

12:12.980 --> 12:16.020
Those of you who have followed us here
should have realised that.

12:16.700 --> 12:17.540
So,

12:17.800 --> 12:20.420
even though they might not
open up to us immediately,

12:20.420 --> 12:22.660
everyone will surely understand one day.

12:23.060 --> 12:24.120
That's true.

12:26.860 --> 12:30.880
What can I do to help them
integrate into the life here?

12:32.660 --> 12:33.930
That's the situation.

12:33.930 --> 12:37.180
All of you will be allowed
to stay in town for protection.

12:37.560 --> 12:41.220
So I'm hoping you can do
something to help the town.

12:41.220 --> 12:43.140
Can you tell me what you're good at?

12:43.520 --> 12:45.640
I'm not sure if we're good at it,

12:45.640 --> 12:49.860
but in Brunn Quelez, we make clothes, weapons, or building facilities that are insufficient

12:49.860 --> 12:52.020
We have also built towns.

12:52.020 --> 12:53.400
That's very impressive.

12:53.400 --> 12:55.080
It seems you guys can do anything.

12:55.260 --> 12:59.480
But Samimina's better at fighting
than making things.

13:00.900 --> 13:03.300
No... I don't want to work.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.920
We'll be abused again.

13:05.920 --> 13:07.300
They'll beat us with whips.

13:07.300 --> 13:09.190
I don't want to work for humans.

13:09.700 --> 13:14.900
I almost forgot that they used to work
under terrible conditions.

13:14.900 --> 13:17.480
I have to quell
their anxieties first.

13:17.910 --> 13:21.220
It's work, but never more than
a reasonable number of hours.

13:21.220 --> 13:22.640
How long is that?

13:22.940 --> 13:26.000
Normally, it should be from 9 AM to 6 PM.

13:26.000 --> 13:27.520
You'll be given breaks
as well, of course.

13:28.440 --> 13:28.980
That's…

13:28.990 --> 13:29.660
So short!

13:29.680 --> 13:30.790
I can't believe it!

13:30.790 --> 13:33.090
- We even get breaks?
- We won't be yelled at, will we?

13:33.090 --> 13:36.000
It seems their previous
working environment was really harsh.

13:36.340 --> 13:40.140
We'll decide the details of the job
and the hours later.

13:40.140 --> 13:41.960
Anyway, thank you all very much.

13:43.140 --> 13:44.100
What's wrong?

13:44.300 --> 13:45.700
It's just that...

13:46.420 --> 13:49.480
People don't thank the Homunculi,

13:49.480 --> 13:50.880
so that was a little surprising.

13:51.380 --> 13:52.280
I see.

13:53.540 --> 13:56.140
Work for the Homunculi?

13:56.140 --> 13:58.480
In that case, how about this?

13:58.640 --> 14:00.640
We'll build a public bathhouse.

14:00.640 --> 14:01.640
Sounds good.

14:02.160 --> 14:04.800
We've gotten requests for a theatre
and more guards too,

14:04.800 --> 14:06.400
but a public bathhouse
might be better.

14:06.660 --> 14:10.000
Those adventurers
could certainly use it.

14:10.280 --> 14:13.120
Some of them are rather unhygienic...

14:13.980 --> 14:16.260
The public bathhouse it is, then.

14:16.260 --> 14:19.340
Manicia, could I have you write up
the proposal to the governor?

14:19.340 --> 14:20.010
Certainly.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.340
By the way,

14:25.040 --> 14:27.580
don't you think Luna's been acting
a little strange lately?

14:27.840 --> 14:28.820
Has she?

14:28.820 --> 14:29.500
Yes.

14:30.120 --> 14:35.560
Can I stay with the Homunculi
at the clan house for a while?

14:36.100 --> 14:39.160
She seemed very concerned
about the Homunculi.

14:39.160 --> 14:41.420
She didn't leave
the second floor today.

14:41.940 --> 14:45.000
Does she have some sort of attachment
towards the Homunculi?

14:49.980 --> 14:50.700
Luna.

14:51.660 --> 14:52.920
Master.

14:52.920 --> 14:54.020
Let me give you a hand.

14:54.020 --> 14:55.640
Did something happen?

14:55.880 --> 14:58.840
Hmm, well, how should I put it?

14:59.000 --> 15:01.400
I have something to tell you.

15:02.890 --> 15:06.620
Since the Homunculi came to Avancier,
you've been quite busy.

15:07.000 --> 15:08.660
So, I was thinking, um...

15:08.660 --> 15:10.900
It might be good for us
to have a chat once in a while.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.080
Of course.

15:12.760 --> 15:15.900
Although it's been decided
to build a public bathhouse,

15:16.080 --> 15:18.900
can they still stay here
once it's finished?

15:19.100 --> 15:21.740
Will they be dismissed
after it's done?

15:21.740 --> 15:22.800
Don't worry.

15:23.300 --> 15:26.460
The higher-ups have already decided
to leave me in charge of everything.

15:26.820 --> 15:28.140
I see.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.240
Luna, are you okay?

15:30.240 --> 15:33.280
You've been spending a lot of time
with the Homunculi lately.

15:33.280 --> 15:36.020
It seems you've also heard
about what happened in Brunn Quelez.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.200
Yes.

15:38.620 --> 15:44.340
I feel so grateful and fortunate
to be brought back by Master.

15:45.880 --> 15:49.800
Maybe Luna doesn't remember much
about life in that country.

15:50.160 --> 15:53.680
That's why it shocked her when she learned
about the other Homunculi.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.440
Speaking of which,

15:58.200 --> 15:59.680
have you told them

16:00.240 --> 16:02.280
that you're a Homunculus?

16:03.180 --> 16:04.900
No, I haven't told any of them.

16:05.260 --> 16:06.810
If I told them,

16:06.810 --> 16:09.860
it might cause you trouble.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.220
I see.

16:11.220 --> 16:14.740
I keep missing the timing
to tell them as well.

16:14.740 --> 16:17.140
It'd be better
if we could tell them soon.

16:17.140 --> 16:18.540
Yes.

16:18.920 --> 16:19.720
But...

16:19.960 --> 16:24.480
Someday, when the people in town aren't
afraid of the Homunculi anymore,

16:24.480 --> 16:26.340
I'll tell them my real identity.

16:26.960 --> 16:30.740
I want them to live happily
as soon as possible,

16:30.740 --> 16:32.760
so I will do my best!

16:33.220 --> 16:35.140
Mm. Everything will work out.

16:35.900 --> 16:37.260
I know you can do it.

16:38.420 --> 16:41.960
I'm really glad I helped you.

16:42.580 --> 16:43.720
Master...

16:51.310 --> 16:53.400
Thank you very much.

16:55.190 --> 16:58.120
To solve the problem faced
by Luna and the other Homunculi,

16:58.720 --> 17:00.920
there is something I must find out.

17:01.380 --> 17:04.000
And who are you looking for?

17:04.000 --> 17:05.540
Amon, just the one I was looking for…

17:05.780 --> 17:06.940
Rud!

17:06.940 --> 17:10.380
Did you make this long journey
just to find me?

17:10.380 --> 17:13.800
Have I completely captivated you?

17:13.800 --> 17:15.810
Hey! Don't cling to me!

17:15.810 --> 17:17.490
Ouch…

17:17.490 --> 17:18.720
Hey! Rud!

17:18.720 --> 17:21.920
How can I be a role model
for my students if they see me like this?!

17:21.920 --> 17:23.099
Students?

17:23.099 --> 17:25.290
I've started teaching magic.

17:25.290 --> 17:27.690
After all, I have
a lot of free time on my hands.

17:27.690 --> 17:30.200
Meanwhile, things are
hectic on my end.

17:30.200 --> 17:32.200
We need extra help
for the construction.

17:32.200 --> 17:34.690
Let the Homunculi handle
that kind of work.

17:35.080 --> 17:38.540
I only do things that interest me.

17:40.600 --> 17:44.240
I want them all to learn magic
from the demon lord herself,

17:44.240 --> 17:46.620
so they can all be future candidates
for demon lords.

17:46.960 --> 17:47.890
That's right.

17:47.890 --> 17:50.700
I came to ask you about demon lords.

17:50.710 --> 17:51.600
About me?

17:51.600 --> 17:54.140
No, about Demon Lord Greed.

17:54.860 --> 18:00.000
Apparently, it was he who brought
the Homunculi technology to Brunn Quelez.

18:00.600 --> 18:05.780
That bloke has always
had a penchant for research.

18:05.790 --> 18:10.260
It's no surprise if he knows a thing
or two about Homunculus technology.

18:10.920 --> 18:13.510
Heard he's currently
mass-producing Homunculi.

18:13.510 --> 18:15.380
Do you know what his purpose is?

18:15.380 --> 18:17.780
Like planning on invading
other countries, for example?

18:17.990 --> 18:21.240
He is probably the last person
who would consider such intentions.

18:21.240 --> 18:22.500
Then why is he doing that?

18:23.940 --> 18:25.780
Probably just to pass the time.

18:26.690 --> 18:29.280
Just to pass the time?

18:30.000 --> 18:32.960
Well, we demon lords aren't
exactly restricted by a lifespan.

18:32.960 --> 18:37.720
Even if we die, one day we'll
resurrect in the same manner.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.760
Immortal, some might say.

18:40.090 --> 18:42.100
I've heard that when you die,
you lose your memories

18:42.100 --> 18:44.600
and come back to life
somewhere else.

18:45.300 --> 18:48.460
Although some can vaguely recall
their past memories,

18:48.460 --> 18:50.960
most forget everything
and simply live on.

18:51.820 --> 18:53.320
That's how it is.

18:53.320 --> 18:58.590
Since we demon lords don't die,
we look for matters to occupy our time.

18:58.720 --> 19:02.400
So, is manufacturing Homunculi
Greed's way

19:02.400 --> 19:04.440
to pass the time
during his lengthy existence?

19:04.960 --> 19:06.940
Not exactly.

19:08.360 --> 19:12.580
Greed has always sought
to create "the strongest."

19:12.900 --> 19:18.000
His research of the Homunculi is
most likely one of his many studies.

19:18.120 --> 19:20.060
To create the strongest?

19:20.420 --> 19:26.360
I suppose the illegal Homunculi are
the closest to being the "strongest".

19:26.370 --> 19:30.040
You're one to talk,
being the closest to "strongest".

19:31.080 --> 19:33.010
The power you possess is something

19:33.010 --> 19:37.180
that even Greed,
after years of research, cannot obtain.

19:37.760 --> 19:40.600
Mana, strengthened by the power
of the demon lord.

19:40.600 --> 19:43.360
Shield force, enhanced
by the power of god.

19:43.360 --> 19:46.520
Possess both, and only then
does one become the strongest.

19:46.520 --> 19:48.880
This is the conclusion
that Greed has reached.

19:49.220 --> 19:52.720
Didn't you use it when you fought me?

19:53.420 --> 19:55.380
The power at that time?

19:55.900 --> 19:59.220
Now I understand
that Greed is pursuing the "strongest".

19:59.220 --> 20:02.580
But why create the Homunculi?

20:02.920 --> 20:06.640
Most probably
to experiment on their bodies.

20:08.300 --> 20:12.860
So, he created Luna and all those Homunculi
just to use them as his test subjects?

20:12.860 --> 20:17.320
He put them through
all that suffering just for his research?

20:17.960 --> 20:19.280
You've got to be kidding me!

20:19.520 --> 20:21.260
Are you angry?

20:21.260 --> 20:22.580
Of course, I am!

20:22.840 --> 20:24.920
Those kids have feelings.

20:24.920 --> 20:27.960
How can I overlook
the atrocities he committed?

20:28.490 --> 20:31.000
What labyrinth is Greed in now?

20:31.340 --> 20:33.860
What? Are you going to take him down?

20:33.860 --> 20:35.160
He's a very powerful man.

20:35.990 --> 20:37.800
With your current strength,

20:37.800 --> 20:40.660
you might not be able
to defeat Greed at all his might.

20:41.990 --> 20:46.640
And even if you do want to defeat him,
your strongest power can be troublesome.

20:47.440 --> 20:50.520
Magic elements come from monsters.

20:50.760 --> 20:52.480
Used excessively,

20:52.480 --> 20:55.240
one's body could become closer
to that of a demon.

20:55.720 --> 20:57.720
Are you telling me to avoid using it?

20:58.040 --> 20:59.920
You should learn to control it.

20:59.920 --> 21:03.640
Those who cannot control mana
will become monsters.

21:03.840 --> 21:06.400
However, control it well...

21:07.340 --> 21:10.200
and you might just turn
into a demon lord.

21:10.790 --> 21:14.120
I have no interest
in becoming a demon lord.

21:14.700 --> 21:15.820
I see.

21:16.400 --> 21:19.280
Well, it's almost time for my lesson.

21:19.620 --> 21:21.580
Let's talk another day, Rud.

21:27.100 --> 21:30.100
In order to protect everyone
when Greed attacks,

21:30.600 --> 21:32.980
I have to become stronger.

21:40.760 --> 21:41.990
Destroy it.
